      en: ["Sousse is the administrative heart of the TN-51 ISO region.", "The city's ancient catacombs date from the 2nd to 4th centuries CE.", "Sousse hosted matches during the 2004 Africa Cup of Nations.", "The Great Mosque was commissioned by Prince Abu al-Abbas Muhammad.", "The city's average elevation is 2 meters above sea level.", "Sousse is a major rail hub connecting Tunis to the southern regions.", "Port El Kantaoui covers an area of 307 hectares of tourist landscape.", "The city was a strategic prize during the North African campaign of WWII."],
