      en: ["Zarzis is connected to Djerba island by a 7km Roman-founded causeway called El Kantara.", "The surrounding region is home to more than 1.3 million olive trees.", "The city was historically a renowned center for Mediterranean sponge fishing.", "Zarzis is located approximately 50 kilometers from the border with Libya.", "The ruins of the ancient Roman city of Gightis are situated nearby.", "The city has a total population of approximately 75,000 residents."],
